    "text": "<p>Magnetic materials used for making permanent magnets&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and magnets in a transformer&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;have different properties of the following, which property best matches for the type of magnet required?</p>"
